# Environment variable template for this project.
#
# Copy this file to `.env.local` and fill in real values:
#
#   cp .env.example .env.local
#
# `.env.local` (and every `.env*` except this example) is gitignored, so
# real secrets never reach version control. Supply only non-sensitive
# placeholders here. See the Security & Secrets guide for the full policy:
# https://github.com/tannergolden/standards/blob/Development/docs/operations/Security-&-Secrets.md
#
# Replace the samples below with the variables your project actually needs.

# EXAMPLE_API_URL=https://api.example.com
# EXAMPLE_API_KEY=replace-with-your-key
